                                  },
                        "description":  {
                                            "en":  "Adds the fill-batch-number skill: feed it an ERP export table and a list of hospitals to skip, and the agent fills 批号 hospital by hospital on the Liaoning drug procurement platform\u0027s 待发货 page, ticks the rows, and confirms shipment. Ships table-parsing and Windows UI helper scripts. Needs a logged-in 360 browser on the same machine; it only fills the 批号 column and never changes expiry dates or notes.",
                                            "zh":  "提供 fill-batch-number 技能：给它一份 ERP 导出表和要跳过的医疗机构名单，它就会在辽宁招采平台的「待发货」页按医疗机构逐家填写批号、勾选并确认发货。附带表格解析脚本和 Windows 界面操作脚本。需要本机已登录的 360 浏览器；只填「批号」一列，不改有效期和备注。"
                                        },
